<h2>A note on service life</h2>
<p>Manufacturers quote life in cycles or years, but the number depends on depth of discharge, temperature and charging. Two batteries with the same label can differ by a factor of two in service if one is cycled at 30% depth and the other at 70%. Ask for the cycle-life basis before comparing products.</p>
